OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 7 JAN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,6,     GWales performs an arrangement of
OL,7,     GSchumann's Marches, Franck's only
OL,8,     Gextant symphony, and Finzi's
OL,9,     GClarinet Concerto with Nicholas
OL,10,     GCarpenter as soloist.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Instrumental
OL,12,     GAlan Hall talks with the Garklein
OL,13,     GRecorder Ensemble from Yorkshire,
OL,14,     Gwhich comprises mostly former
OL,15,     Gperipatetic music teachers who
OL,16,     Ghave migrated to recorders from
OL,17,     Gother instruments.
